| **Will they pay?** | 50%+ willing to pilot at $50-75k | Airline Group 1 |
| **Can we integrate easily?** | AMOS/Ramco confirm API access in <6 months | ERP Group 3 |
| **Is channel viable?** | 2+ MROs express partnership interest | MRO Group 2 |
| **Platform opportunity?** | AVIATAR or Skywise interested in discussions | Platform Group 4 |
| **Academic credibility?** | Cambridge/Cranfield willing to collaborate | Academic Group 5 |

#### **GO/NO-GO Decision Thresholds:**

**STRONG GO (Proceed with Confidence):**
- ✅ 5+ airlines express pilot interest (>7/10 value rating)
- ✅ 2+ airlines commit to pilot LOIs
- ✅ 1+ ERP partner confirms integration path
- ✅ Academic validation partner secured
- ✅ 1+ MRO or platform partnership discussions active

**CAUTIOUS GO (Proceed with Adjustments):**
- ✅ 3-4 airlines express interest but need proof first
- ✅ Integration more complex than expected but feasible
- ✅ Pricing needs adjustment (lower or success-based)
- ✅ Pivot to MRO channel vs. direct needed

**NO-GO (Pivot or Abandon):**
- ❌ <3 airlines see value (not a real pain point)
- ❌ Integration impossible or >12 months
- ❌ No one willing to pilot even at low/no cost
- ❌ OEMs already building similar features (timing risk)
- ❌ No academic partner willing to validate

